<h1 class="tcs-policy-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
<div class="entry-content">
<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 19, 2026</p>
<p>At <strong>The Coffee Sleeves</strong>, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and safeguarded when you visit or make a purchase from <strong><a class="decorated-link" href="/" rel="noopener">https://thecoffeesleeves.com/</a></strong> (the “Website”).</p>
<p>By using our Website, you agree to the practices described in this policy.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We collect information in two main ways: information you provide directly and information collected automatically.</p>
<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
<p>When you interact with our Website, place an order, or contact us, we may collect:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Full name</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Email address</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Phone number</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Billing and shipping address</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Order details and transaction records</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Payment information is handled securely by third-party payment processors. We do not store or have direct access to your card or banking details.</p>
<h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
<p>When you browse our Website, certain information is collected automatically, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>IP address</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Browser type and device information</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Pages viewed and time spent on the Website</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Referral source</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>This data helps us understand how visitors use our Website and allows us to improve performance and usability.</p>
<hr />
<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>Your information is used strictly for business and operational purposes, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Processing and fulfilling orders</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Communicating order updates and responding to inquiries</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Improving website functionality and user experience</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Preventing fraud and unauthorized activity</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Sending promotional or informational emails when you choose to receive them</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not use your personal information for purposes unrelated to our services.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
<p>Our Website uses cookies and similar technologies to ensure proper functionality and enhance user experience. Cookies help us:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Remember user preferences</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Maintain shopping cart functionality</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Analyze website traffic and performance</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>You can disable cookies through your browser settings, though some parts of the Website may not function properly as a result.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Sharing of Information</h2>
<p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information.</p>
<p>Your data may be shared only with trusted third parties when necessary, such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Payment processing providers</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Shipping and logistics partners</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Website hosting and analytics services</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Information may also be disclosed if required by law or to protect our legal rights.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Data Security</h2>
<p>We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure. While we work hard to safeguard your data, no online transmission or storage method can be guaranteed as completely secure.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Your Rights and Choices</h2>
<p>You have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Request corrections or updates to your information</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Request deletion of your personal data, where legally permitted</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Opt out of marketing communications at any time</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>To exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
<p>Our Website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any information.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
<p>The Coffee Sleeves does not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under the age of 13. If we become aware that such information has been collected, it will be removed promptly.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Any updates will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.</p>
<hr />
<h2>Contact Information</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us:</p>
